  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We Effect - Agriculture &amp; Natural Resource Program           (ARENA) 2013-2016 - We Effect ARENA Program 2013 -2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">We Effect - Jordbruk &amp; naturresurs Program (ARENA) 2013-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARENA has as impact objective &quot;Increased participation by             community-based rights- holders (women and men) in Niassa Province in management of Nature Resources with focus on agriculture&quot;. The        program will cover 3 areas: access to land and natural resources      management; local economic development for smallholder farmers; and   access to information and knowledge management.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ARENA has as impact objective &quot;Increased participation by             community-based rights- holders (women and men) in Niassa Province in management of Nature Resources with focus on agriculture&quot;. The        program will cover 3 areas: access to land and natural resources      management; local economic development for smallholder farmers; and   access to information and knowledge management.</narrative>
  </description>
